# UI Space Optimization Guidelines

## Core Principles

### 1. Maximize Viewport Utilization
- **Remove excessive margins**: Use `width: '100%'` instead of `maxWidth` constraints
- **Responsive padding**: Use `px: { xs: 1, sm: 2, md: 3 }` for adaptive spacing
- **Full-width containers**: Avoid fixed max-widths that create empty space on larger screens

### 2. Efficient Settings Layout
- **Column-based organization**: Group related settings in columns rather than stacking vertically
- **Responsive grid breakpoints**: Use `xs={12} sm={6} lg={3/4}` patterns for optimal space usage
- **Integrated action buttons**: Place primary actions within settings panels to reduce UI clutter

### 3. Content Area Optimization
- **Increased text area heights**: Use 600px+ for input/output areas instead of 500px
- **Side-by-side layouts**: Utilize lg={6} for input/output on larger screens
- **Proper scrolling**: Ensure text areas are scrollable with `overflow: 'auto'`

## Layout Patterns

### ✅ Recommended Layout Structure
```tsx
<Box sx={{ width: '100%', px: { xs: 1, sm: 2, md: 3 } }}>
  {/* Tool Header */}
  <Box sx={{ mb: 3 }}>
    <Typography variant="h4" component="h1" gutterBottom>
      Tool Name
    </Typography>
    <Typography variant="body1" color="text.secondary" paragraph>
      Tool description
    </Typography>
  </Box>

  <Grid container spacing={3}>
    {/* Settings Panel - Organized in columns */}
    <Grid item xs={12}>
      <Card sx={{ mb: 3 }}>
        <CardContent>
          <Typography variant="h6" gutterBottom>
            Settings
          </Typography>
          
          <Grid container spacing={2}>
            {/* Main settings in columns */}
            <Grid item xs={12} sm={6} lg={3}>
              <FormControl fullWidth>
                {/* Preset/Mode selection */}
              </FormControl>
            </Grid>
            
            <Grid item xs={12} sm={6} lg={3}>
              {/* Configuration options */}
            </Grid>
            
            <Grid item xs={12} sm={6} lg={3}>
              {/* Additional settings */}
            </Grid>
            
            <Grid item xs={12} sm={6} lg={3}>
              {/* Action buttons integrated in settings */}
              <Box sx={{ display: 'flex', gap: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Button variant="contained" fullWidth size="large">
                  Primary Action
                </Button>
                <Button variant="outlined" fullWidth>
                  Secondary Action
                </Button>
              </Box>
            </Grid>

            {/* Secondary settings in grouped columns */}
            <Grid item xs={12} sm={6} lg={4}>
              <Typography variant="subtitle2" gutterBottom>
                Category 1 Options
              </Typography>
              <FormGroup>
                {/* Related switches/options */}
              </FormGroup>
            </Grid>
            
            <Grid item xs={12} sm={6} lg={4}>
              <Typography variant="subtitle2" gutterBottom>
                Category 2 Options
              </Typography>
              <FormGroup>
                {/* Related switches/options */}
              </FormGroup>
            </Grid>
            
            <Grid item xs={12} sm={6} lg={4}>
              <Typography variant="subtitle2" gutterBottom>
                Category 3 Options
              </Typography>
              <FormGroup>
                {/* Related switches/options */}
              </FormGroup>
            </Grid>
          </Grid>
        </CardContent>
      </Card>
    </Grid>

    {/* Input/Output Areas - Full width utilization */}
    <Grid item xs={12} lg={6}>
      <Paper sx={{ p: 2, height: '600px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Typography variant="h6" gutterBottom>Input</Typography>
        <TextField
          multiline
          fullWidth
          sx={{
            flexGrow: 1,
            '& .MuiInputBase-input': {
              height: '100% !important',
              overflow: 'auto !important',
            },
          }}
        />
      </Paper>
    </Grid>
    
    <Grid item xs={12} lg={6}>
      <Paper sx={{ p: 2, height: '600px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Typography variant="h6" gutterBottom>Output</Typography>
        <TextField
          multiline
          fullWidth
          InputProps={{ readOnly: true }}
          sx={{
            flexGrow: 1,
            '& .MuiInputBase-input': {
              height: '100% !important',
              overflow: 'auto !important',
            },
          }}
        />
      </Paper>
    </Grid>

    {/* Results/Metadata - Full width */}
    <Grid item xs={12}>
      <Card>
        <CardContent>
          <Typography variant="h6" gutterBottom>Results</Typography>
          <Grid container spacing={2}>
            <Grid item xs={6} sm={4} lg={2}>
              {/* Metric 1 */}
            </Grid>
            <Grid item xs={6} sm={4} lg={2}>
              {/* Metric 2 */}
            </Grid>
            {/* Continue pattern for 6 metrics on large screens */}
          </Grid>
        </CardContent>
      </Card>
    </Grid>
  </Grid>
</Box>
```

### ❌ Avoid These Patterns
```tsx
// DON'T: Excessive containers and max-widths
<Box sx={{ maxWidth: '1200px', mx: 'auto', p: 4 }}>
  <Container maxWidth="lg">
    {/* Creates unnecessary empty space */}
  </Container>
</Box>

// DON'T: Vertical stacking of all settings
<Grid container spacing={3}>
  <Grid item xs={12}>
    <FormControl fullWidth>
      {/* Setting 1 */}
    </FormControl>
  </Grid>
  <Grid item xs={12}>
    <FormControl fullWidth>
      {/* Setting 2 */}
    </FormControl>
  </Grid>
  {/* Results in excessive vertical scrolling */}
</Grid>

// DON'T: Separate action button section
<Grid item xs={12}>
  <Box sx={{ display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 2 }}>
    <Button>Action 1</Button>
    <Button>Action 2</Button>
  </Box>
</Grid>
```

## Responsive Breakpoints

### Grid Sizing Strategy
- **xs={12}**: All items full width on mobile
- **sm={6}**: Two columns on tablets
- **lg={3}**: Four columns for main settings on desktop
- **lg={4}**: Three columns for secondary settings groups
- **lg={2}**: Six columns for metrics/results

### Text Area Dimensions
- **Height**: Minimum 600px for input/output areas
- **Width**: Full width with proper responsive padding
- **Scrolling**: Always enable with `overflow: 'auto !important'`

## Common Space Wasters to Avoid

1. **Excessive margins and padding**: Use responsive spacing
2. **Fixed max-widths**: Let content use available space
3. **Vertical setting stacks**: Organize in columns
4. **Separate action sections**: Integrate with settings
5. **Small text areas**: Increase to 600px+ height
6. **Unnecessary containers**: Reduce nesting

## Testing Checklist

- [ ] No horizontal empty space on 1920px+ screens
- [ ] Settings organized efficiently in columns
- [ ] Text areas are properly scrollable
- [ ] All interactive elements are easily accessible
- [ ] Layout adapts well to mobile (xs), tablet (sm), and desktop (lg+)
- [ ] Action buttons are prominently placed and easily accessible
- [ ] Content flows naturally without excessive scrolling

